    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"slump\" though. i can feel it in my bones. the gap between what's in my head and what comes out of my hands is becoming permanent. i'm not \"changing,\" i'm just becoming a worse version of myself. it's like i'm watching a slow-motion car crash of my own talent. if i keep going, i'm just going to end up being some washed-up parody of what i used to be. i'd rather just stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
