    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a way to sugarcoat it, isn't it? if the talent is gone, the person who made it is gone too. there's no \"new way\" to be mediocre. i just feel like there's this dignity in leaving early, you know? instead of dragging this out until i'm just a pathetic shadow of myself, staying in that space where people still respect what i did... it feels like the only logical thing left to do.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
